Golgothian Sylex
Kiki-Jiki, Mirror Breaker
Black Lotus x3
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
